<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>whiskey sips</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">BAD !DEA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">whiskey sips</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">17VPruZsxBbSBwPsF20dQr</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.760" end="00:24.200">하루가 지나도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.200" end="00:28.700">니 얼굴은 맘속에서는</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.700" end="00:30.200">잊지못하고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.880" end="00:34.040">너는 또 그립고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.040" end="00:36.120">오늘도 달빛에</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.120" end="00:38.320">밤하늘 바라보면서</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.320" end="00:41.740">넌 자꼬 내 마음에</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.740" end="00:43.240">벗어나지못해</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.200" end="00:49.960">Darling you got me wrapped around your fingertips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.960" end="00:55.640">Dancing on my lips with our hearts intertwined</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.640" end="01:00.990">Yearning for your kiss in between these whiskey sips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.990" end="01:07.960">Gets me high, all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.960" end="01:09.680">Girl I can’t breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.680" end="01:12.520">The stars they’re callin’ me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.520" end="01:15.320">The moon she’s whisperin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.320" end="01:19.160">Your love is what I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.160" end="01:20.960">Boy I can’t see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.960" end="01:23.840">The sun is blindin’ me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.840" end="01:26.640">The ocean’s whisperin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.640" end="01:31.920">Your touch it sets me free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.920" end="01:33.680">Uh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.680" end="01:35.480">또다시 너의 입술이생각나네</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.480" end="01:37.400">달빛밑에 내품에 안겼던 그데</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.400" end="01:39.840">같이 보낸 무든 추억들 요즘은 뮈하니</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.840" end="01:42.880">나의 전화도 왜받지 않니</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.880" end="01:44.680">내게 보낸 문자들 답이없고</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.680" end="01:46.180">넌날 사랑한다고 할데는 그런순간도</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.900" end="01:49.260">계속 너의 말로 나를 다시 이끌어가네</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.260" end="01:53.240">이제나는 너의 가목에 또갖혀저 있네</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.240" end="01:55.880">One touch you got me in a trance baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.880" end="01:58.760">I won’t let you slip right through my hands baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.760" end="02:01.560">Say my name and do it all again baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.560" end="02:03.060">Are you ready</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.560" end="02:04.440">Coz you’re already</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.440" end="02:06.600">On my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.600" end="02:10.080">다시 말해 봐</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.080" end="02:11.840">걱정하지 마</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.840" end="02:14.680">You’re the only one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.680" end="02:20.320">Darling you got me wrapped around your fingertips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.320" end="02:26.000">Dancing on my lips with our hearts intertwined</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.000" end="02:31.350">Yearning for your kiss in between these whiskey sips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.350" end="02:38.320">Gets me high, all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.320" end="02:40.000">Girl I can’t breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.000" end="02:42.880">The stars they’re callin’ me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.880" end="02:45.680">The moon she’s whisperin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.680" end="02:49.520">Your love is what I need</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.520" end="02:51.360">Boy I can’t see</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.360" end="02:54.160">The sun is blindin’ me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.160" end="02:57.000">The ocean’s whisperin’</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.000" end="03:05.000">Your touch it sets me free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.840" end="03:10.340">I mean</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.200" end="03:11.800">이렇게 되는 것 같아</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:11.800" end="03:15.280">You got me wrapped a-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.280" end="03:16.870">Wrapped around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.870" end="03:19.690">Baby I can’t breathe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.690" end="03:21.360">When you’re around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.360" end="03:22.860">You’re around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.420" end="03:29.140">Why’re we playin’ games if you’re down and I’m down?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.140" end="03:30.640">(In be-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.680" end="03:31.180">In between these whiskey sips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.080" end="03:32.580">In be-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.560" end="03:33.060">In between these</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.980" end="03:34.480">In between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.070" end="03:36.440">‘tween</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.440" end="03:43.140">‘tween)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.140" end="03:44.640">자기야</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:43.950" end="03:45.450">보고 싶다</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:44.580" end="03:48.580">답변 기다릴게</p></div></body></tt>